<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Waterford foods talks with Avonmore.</title>
<headline>Waterford foods talks with Avonmore.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish food group Waterford Foods Plc said it that it has received an approach from Avonmore Food Plc which may or may not lead to an offer.</p>
<p>Waterford said in a statement that if an offer was received it would be evaluated in due course.</p>
<p>Industry sources said this appeared to be a renewal of merger attempts which were aborted in 1991.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>Waterford said in one year ago that market conditions were depressed and it was considering a merger, partnership or strategic alliance.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353-1-6613377</p>
</text>
